{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"a1-practice-40","level":"A1","kind":"mcq","title":{"de":"Adjektive","bn":"বিশেষণ"},"questions":[{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Das ist ein neues Auto.“ মানে কী?","options":["এটি একটি পুরানো গাড়ি।","এটি একটি নতুন গাড়ি।","গাড়িটি নতুন।"],"answer":1,"id":"a1-practice-40-q1"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Das ist ein ___ Mann. (সুন্দর)","options":["schöne","schönes","schöner"],"answer":2,"explanation":"der Mann → ein schöner।","id":"a1-practice-40-q2"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Das ist eine ___ Frau. (সুন্দর)","options":["schöne","schöner","schönes"],"answer":0,"explanation":"die Frau → eine schöne।","id":"a1-practice-40-q3"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Das ist ein ___ Buch. (নতুন)","options":["neue","neues","neuer"],"answer":1,"explanation":"das Buch → ein neues।","id":"a1-practice-40-q4"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"কোন বাক্যে Adjective-এর পরে ending নেই?","options":["Das ist ein neues Auto.","Ich habe ein neues Auto.","Das Auto ist neu."],"answer":2,"explanation":"sein-এর পরে Adjective-এ ending বসে না।","id":"a1-practice-40-q5"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Meine Wohnung ist klein.“ মানে কী?","options":["আমার অ্যাপার্টমেন্টটি ছোট।","আমার অ্যাপার্টমেন্টটি বড়।","আমার অ্যাপার্টমেন্টটি নতুন।"],"answer":0,"id":"a1-practice-40-q6"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„jung“-এর বিপরীত কোনটি?","options":["klein","alt","neu"],"answer":1,"id":"a1-practice-40-q7"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich habe eine ___ Idee. (ভালো)","options":["guter","gutes","gute"],"answer":2,"explanation":"die Idee → eine gute।","id":"a1-practice-40-q8"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich bin müde, ___ ich lerne. (কিন্তু)","options":["aber","und","oder"],"answer":0,"id":"a1-practice-40-q9"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„denn“ মানে কী?","options":["কিন্তু","অথবা","কারণ"],"answer":2,"id":"a1-practice-40-q10"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Tee oder Kaffee?“ মানে কী?","options":["চা নাকি কফি?","চা এবং কফি?","চা কিন্তু কফি?"],"answer":0,"id":"a1-practice-40-q11"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich fahre mit ___ Zug.","options":["der"